<title>CHINA: Bank Negara Indonesia sets US dlr FRCD.</title>
<headline>Bank Negara Indonesia sets US dlr FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger Sakura Merchant Bank (Singapore).</p>
<p> BORROWER    BANK NEGARA INDONESIA</p>
<p>		 (A)  ACTING THROUGH ITS HONG KONG BRANCH</p>
<p>		 (B)  ACTING THROUGH ITS SINGAPORE BRANCH</p>
<p> AMOUNT	(A)  US$40 MLN, (B)  US$30 MLN</p>
<p> COUPON	L+35BP     MATURITY    3 YEARS</p>
<p> TYPE	  FRCD	 ISS PRICE   PAR	LAUNCHED  28.JUL.97</p>
<p> PUTS	  NONE	 CALLS	 NONE     REPLIES   15.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING     NONE	 REPAYMENT   BULLET   DENOMS    US$500K</p>
<p> RATING	--	   SALE LMTS   STANDARD HOME CTRY INDONESIA</p>
<p> NEG PLG     --	   CRS DEF     --	 FORCE MAJ --</p>
<p> MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>   LEAD MANAGERS	US$7 MLN+     43.5BP   ALL-IN  49.5</p>
<p>   SENIOR MANAGERS    US$5-7 MLN    37.5BP   ALL-IN  47.5</p>
<p>   MANAGERS	     US$3-5 MLN    31.5BP   ALL-IN  45.5</p>
<p>ARRANGERS  BNP SINGAPORE (BOOKS), DEVELOPMENT BANK OF</p>
<p>		SINGAPORE, NATEXIS BANQUE-BFCE, SAKURA MERCHANT BANK</p>
<p>		SINGAPORE (BOOKS) AND NIKKO BANK</p>
<p> NOTES	THERE IS EARLY REDEMPTION IN THE EVENT THAT THE</p>
<p>		REPUBLIC OF INDONESIA HOLDS LESS THAN 51 PCT OF THE</p>
<p>		ISSUED CAPITAL OF THE BORROWER.</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
